### 7. Non-PR Event (Should be ignored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/github
Content-Type: application/json
X-GitHub-Event: push
X-GitHub-Delivery: 12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789mno

{
  "ref": "refs/heads/main",
  "repository": {
    "name": "test-repo",
    "full_name": "testuser/test-repo"
  }
}

